        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# HCP KAS Golden Signals\n\nKAS availability is measured via the KSM `hostedClusterAPI_kubeapiserver_available` signal. Alerts: `userJourneyKubeApiserverAvailability1h5m`, `userJourneyKubeApiserverAvailability6h30m`, `userJourneyKubeApiserverAvailability3d6h`.\n\n**Runbook**: See [HCP Metrics SRE Guide](https://github.com/Azure/ARO-HCP/blob/main/docs/sre/hcp-metrics.md) for burn rate thresholds and response procedures.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.4.13",
      "title": "Dashboard Overview [TITLE UPDATE]",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
